<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China E'bright Tech suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China E'bright Tech suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of China Everbright Technology Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
</text>
